+//! NemoWorld world dressing: props and furnished interiors in a Veloren site, from a manifest.
+//!
+//! * `logic`: the pure rules — what a manifest may ask for, what the game can really place, what has
+//!   already been applied, and the idempotence rule. Unit tested over an in-memory terrain.
+//! * `dress`: the server system that resolves a manifest's anchors from world generation, writes the
+//!   blocks through `BlockChange`, records what it applied next to the outbox, and follows NemoWorld's
+//!   clock for the time of day.
+//!
+//! Registered with one `#[path]` module line and one `dispatch` line in `sys/mod.rs`, and one resource
